k></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TATEKAWA MASAICHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TSUJIMOTO TAKAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AIZAWA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ARRAY PRINTERS AB</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIURA, MASAYOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TATEKAWA, MASAICHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUJIMOTO, TAKAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AIZAWA MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIURA MASAYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TATEKAWA MASAICHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TSUJIMOTO TAKAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AIZAWA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIURA, MASAYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TATEKAWA, MASAICHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUJIMOTO, TAKAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A control electrode (14) and a deflection electrode (16) are provided on the front and rear sides of an insulating substrate (25), and protective insulating layers (28) are then formed over both sides. A hole (13) is opened through the protective layer (28) on the front side of the insulating substrate (25) using a punch (50) whose diameter d2 is greater than the inside diameter d0 of the control electrode (14). Exposed parts (19) of the control electrode (14) and the deflection electrode (16) are etched toward the outside of the hole (13). The edges (18) of the protective layers (28) are bent toward the insulating substrate (25) so as to cover the control electrode (14) and the deflection electrode (16).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Le procédé de l'invention consiste à utiliser une électrode active (14) et une électrode déflectrice (16) disposées sur les bords avant et arrière d'un substrat isolant (25), puis à réaliser des couches de protection isolantes chevauchant les deux bords. On réalise ensuite un trou (13) dans la couche de protection (28) du bord avant du substrat isolant (25) au moyen d'un poinçon (50) dont le diamètre (d2) est supérieur au diamètre intérieur (d0) de l'électrode active (14). Les zones découvertes (19) de l'électrode active (14) et de l'électrode déflectrice (16) subissent une attaque chimique progressant en direction de l'extérieur du trou (13). Les bords (18) des couches de protection (28) sont recourbées vers le substrat isolant (25) de façon à recouvrir l'électrode active (14) et l'électrode déflectrice (16).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to